-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">240 seconds<br/><small>(20% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.9<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2006<br/>Christmas Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20061211002341&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gingerbreadman_4309e3.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a gingerbreadman.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 5.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Mmmm.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Can be gotten by <a href=\"#/wiki/Santa%20Claus\">Santa Claus</a> at Christmas Time, Trading 10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Token\">Christmas Tokens</a> for the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Recipe\">Gingerbread Recipe</a> or by trading 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Token\">Christmas Token</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ruprecht\">Ruprecht</a> near Santa's house on <a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a>.<br/>\nIt could also be obtained from <a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblins</a> on the Santa Event\n15 of them are needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblin</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ruprecht\">Ruprecht</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Token\">Christmas Token</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Blue Christmas Bundle</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a></li><li>Christmas</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Bakery\">Christmas Bakery</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Token\">Christmas Token</a></li><li>Cooking</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demonic%20Candy%20Ball\">Demonic Candy Ball</a></li><li>Event Creatures</li><li